{"seq":2,"slug":"intrinsic-value-and-margin-of-safety","title":"内在价值与安全边际","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/warren-buffett/core-contributions/value-investing/intrinsic-value-and-margin-of-safety","wordCount":1633,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"内在价值与安全边际\">内在价值与安全边际</h1><p>如果说 <a href=\"the-value-investing-approach\">价值投资之道</a> 给出的是&quot;怎么做&quot;的操作框架，那么内在价值（intrinsic value）与安全边际（margin of safety）就是支撑整套框架的两个量化支点：前者回答&quot;这家公司到底值多少钱&quot;，后者回答&quot;我愿意为不确定性预留多大缓冲&quot;。这两个概念都源自格雷厄姆，但巴菲特对它们的运用——尤其是把&quot;内在价值&quot;从静态清算价值推进到&quot;未来现金流折现&quot;——是他在估值方法上的实质贡献。本篇专讲估值机制；为什么集中下注、为什么长期持有，见 <a href=\"the-value-investing-approach\">价值投资之道</a> 与 <a href=\"../landmark-investments/the-long-term-portfolio\">长期投资组合</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>内在价值</strong>：企业在余下生命中能取出现金的折现值，由所有者收益决定。</li>\n<li><strong>所有者收益</strong>：净利润 + 折旧摊销 − 维持竞争地位所需的资本开支。</li>\n<li><strong>安全边际</strong>：买入价相对内在价值的折扣，承担容错与收益放大双重功能。</li>\n<li><strong>大致正确</strong>：宁要保守的价值区间，不要精确到小数点的虚假精度。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"内在价值的定义-所有者收益的折现\">内在价值的定义：所有者收益的折现</h2><p>巴菲特在伯克希尔多封致股东信中给出的定义最为精炼：&quot;内在价值是一家企业在其余下生命中可以取出的现金的折现值。&quot;用现金流折现（DCF）写成公式：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>V</mi><mo>=</mo><munderover><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>n</mi></munderover><mfrac><mrow><mi>F</mi><mi>C</mi><msub><mi>F</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>r</mi><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi>t</mi></msup></mrow></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>T</mi><msub><mi>V</mi><mi>n</mi></msub></mrow><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>r</mi><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi>n</mi></msup></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">V = \\sum_{t=1}^{n} \\frac{FCF_t}{(1+r)^t} + \\frac{TV_n}{(1+r)^n}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.9185em;vertical-align:-1.2671em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.6514em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8829em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">=</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.3em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.2671em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mclose\"><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7196em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.989em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.936em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.2963em;vertical-align:-0.936em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mclose\"><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.5904em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.989em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.2222em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.936em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>F</mi><mi>C</mi><msub><mi>F</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">FCF_t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是第 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6151em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span></span></span></span></span> 年的自由现金流（巴菲特称之为&quot;所有者收益&quot;owner earnings），<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>r</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span></span></span></span></span> 是折现率，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>T</mi><msub><mi>V</mi><mi>n</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">TV_n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.2222em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是终值。巴菲特的所有者收益有一个关键修正，区别于会计净利润：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>所有者收益</mtext><mo>=</mo><mtext>净利润</mtext><mo>+</mo><mtext>折旧摊销</mtext><mo>−</mo><mtext>维持竞争地位所需的资本开支</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{所有者收益} = \\text{净利润} + \\text{折旧摊销} - \\text{维持竞争地位所需的资本开支}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">所有者收益</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">净利润</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">折旧摊销</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">维持竞争地位所需的资本开支</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>最后一项&quot;维持性资本开支&quot;是精髓——一家名义利润很高、却必须不断把利润砸回设备更新才能维持现状的重资产企业（巴菲特称之为&quot;不幸的生意&quot;），其真实所有者收益远低于账面净利润。这正是他偏爱 <a href=\"../landmark-investments/sees-candies-and-coca-cola\">喜诗糖果</a> 这类&quot;轻资产、高回报&quot;企业的财务根因：喜诗用约 4000 万美元的累计投入产生了超过 20 亿美元的税前利润（来源：Quartr、Event Driven Daily 对伯克希尔致股东信数据的整理）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"折现率与-大致正确\">折现率与&quot;大致正确&quot;</h2><p>巴菲特拒绝精确到小数点的估值，他的名言是&quot;宁要大致正确，不要精确错误&quot;（better to be approximately right than precisely wrong）。这体现在三处刻意的&quot;模糊&quot;：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>参数</th>\n<th>学院派做法</th>\n<th>巴菲特做法</th>\n<th>理由</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>折现率 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>r</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>用 CAPM 算 β 加权</td>\n<td>直接用长期国债利率（不加风险溢价）</td>\n<td>风险靠安全边际而非靠提高折现率来处理</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>现金流预测</td>\n<td>详尽建模 5–10 年分项</td>\n<td>只投预测得&quot;高度确定&quot;的生意</td>\n<td>看不清就放进太难箱，见 <a href=\"../../ideas-and-methods/investment-philosophy/circle-of-competence\">能力圈</a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>终值 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>T</mi><mi>V</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">TV</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>永续增长率敏感性分析</td>\n<td>要求护城河保证长期稳定</td>\n<td>见 <a href=\"../../ideas-and-methods/economic-moats/the-moat-concept\">护城河概念</a></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>巴菲特用国债利率而非风险调整折现率，是一个常被误解的细节：他不是忽视风险，而是把风险处理转移到了&quot;安全边际&quot;这一道独立闸门，避免在折现率里重复计算风险、把估值搞成&quot;调参游戏&quot;。</p>\n<h2 id=\"安全边际-为误差和坏运气留缓冲\">安全边际：为误差和坏运气留缓冲</h2><p>格雷厄姆把安全边际称为&quot;稳健投资的三个最重要的字&quot;。巴菲特用工程类比解释它：&quot;如果你要造一座承重三万磅的桥，你会把它造成能承重五万磅。&quot;——多出的两万磅就是安全边际。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart LR&#10;    A[估算内在价值&lt;br/&gt;例: 100元/股] --&gt; B[要求安全边际&lt;br/&gt;例: 折价40%]&#10;    B --&gt; C[设定买入上限&lt;br/&gt;60元/股]&#10;    C --&gt; D{市场报价?}&#10;    D -- 75元 --&gt; E[等待: 价格未到位]&#10;    D -- 55元 --&gt; F[买入: 价值得到双重保护]&#10;    F --&gt; G[保护1: 估值错误的容错]&#10;    F --&gt; G2[保护2: 意外坏消息的缓冲]\">flowchart LR\n    A[估算内在价值&lt;br/&gt;例: 100元/股] --&gt; B[要求安全边际&lt;br/&gt;例: 折价40%]\n    B --&gt; C[设定买入上限&lt;br/&gt;60元/股]\n    C --&gt; D{市场报价?}\n    D -- 75元 --&gt; E[等待: 价格未到位]\n    D -- 55元 --&gt; F[买入: 价值得到双重保护]\n    F --&gt; G[保护1: 估值错误的容错]\n    F --&gt; G2[保护2: 意外坏消息的缓冲]</pre><p>安全边际同时承担两个功能：一是容错（你对内在价值的估算本来就有误差），二是收益放大（折价越深，价值回归时的上行空间越大）。设内在价值 100 元：以 60 元买入，回归时收益 67%；以 80 元买入，回归时收益仅 25%。同样的判断，入场价决定了回报的量级——这也是为什么巴菲特宁愿持币等待&quot;挥棒区&quot;内的好球，2024 年末伯克希尔持有创纪录的约 3340 亿美元现金（来源：CNBC、伯克希尔 2024Q4 新闻稿）就是&quot;宁等不将就&quot;的极端体现。</p>\n<h2 id=\"价格与价值的辩证-利用市场先生\">价格与价值的辩证：利用市场先生</h2><p>&quot;价格是你付出的，价值是你得到的&quot;（Price is what you pay; value is what you get）——这句巴菲特名言把两个概念连成一组辩证关系。市场短期是&quot;投票机&quot;（被情绪左右的报价），长期是&quot;称重机&quot;（向内在价值回归）。聪明投资者要做的，是把市场先生反复无常的报价当作可利用的机会，而非需要追随的指令。这一拟人化的&quot;市场先生&quot;完整论述，见兄弟 hub 的 <a href=\"../../ideas-and-methods/investment-philosophy/mr-market-and-temperament\">市场先生与投资气质</a>，本篇不展开。</p>\n<h2 id=\"反模式-估值最容易犯的错\">反模式：估值最容易犯的错</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>反模式</th>\n<th>表现</th>\n<th>后果与纠正</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>精确的虚假</td>\n<td>DCF 建到小数点后两位</td>\n<td>输入垃圾出垃圾；改用保守区间</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>把增长当价值</td>\n<td>高增长股不论价格都买</td>\n<td>增长只有在 ROIC&gt;资本成本时才创造价值</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>安全边际归零</td>\n<td>牛市里&quot;这次不一样&quot;取消折价</td>\n<td>一旦判断出错或遇黑天鹅毫无缓冲</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>用维持性资本开支充当增长</td>\n<td>把必要更新算成扩张</td>\n<td>高估自由现金流，DCF 系统性偏高</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>折现率随心情调</td>\n<td>想买就调低 r、不想买就调高</td>\n<td>估值沦为合理化工具而非判断工具</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>内在价值与安全边际构成一对互补工具：内在价值是&quot;靶心&quot;（用所有者收益折现求出企业真实价值），安全边际是&quot;瞄准时的留量&quot;（用大幅折价吸收估值误差与坏运气）。巴菲特的贡献在于把这两个概念从格雷厄姆式的&quot;清算价值 + 折价&quot;升级为&quot;未来现金流 + 护城河保证的确定性 + 折价&quot;，从而能给一家持续经营、拥有品牌的好公司估值——这正是从捡烟蒂走向买伟大企业的估值基础。</p>\n<p>延伸阅读：这套估值如何选出具体标的，见 <a href=\"../landmark-investments/sees-candies-and-coca-cola\">喜诗糖果与可口可乐</a>；护城河如何保证终值的可靠性，见 <a href=\"../../ideas-and-methods/economic-moats/the-moat-concept\">护城河概念</a>；六十年的复利账本，见 <a href=\"../../major-works/investment-record/the-compounding-machine\">复利机器</a>。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"内在价值与安全边际","id":"内在价值与安全边际"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"内在价值的定义：所有者收益的折现","id":"内在价值的定义-所有者收益的折现"},{"level":2,"text":"折现率与\"大致正确\"","id":"折现率与-大致正确"},{"level":2,"text":"安全边际：为误差和坏运气留缓冲","id":"安全边际-为误差和坏运气留缓冲"},{"level":2,"text":"价格与价值的辩证：利用市场先生","id":"价格与价值的辩证-利用市场先生"},{"level":2,"text":"反模式：估值最容易犯的错","id":"反模式-估值最容易犯的错"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"价值投资之道","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/warren-buffett/core-contributions/value-investing/the-value-investing-approach"},"next":{"title":"保险浮存金模式","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/warren-buffett/core-contributions/the-berkshire-empire/the-insurance-float-model"}}